## Security & compliance

- [Trust Center](https://compliance.goodnotes.com/): Certifications and security documentation — SOC 2 Type II, SOC 3, ISO/IEC 27001, GDPR, CCPA, and NIST Cybersecurity Framework. Pentest reports, subprocessor lists, and the Data Processing Addendum are available on request.
- Goodnotes Education is aligned with FERPA, COPPA, GDPR, and the NIST Cybersecurity Framework, on top of the SOC 2 Type II and ISO 27001 certifications held company-wide.
- Data is stored via Goodnotes Cloud on AWS-managed servers, encrypted at rest and segregated in a private network.
- [Terms and Conditions](https://www.goodnotes.com/terms-and-conditions): General Terms, EU Supplemental Terms, and links to the Privacy Policy, Data Processing Addendum, Goodnotes for Business EULA, and the Education Licence Agreement & Data Processing Agreement for schools.
- Admin Console (Teams and Enterprise): SAML SSO, domain control (enforce sign-in with company accounts), feature control (enable/disable AI and sharing settings), consolidated billing, and usage analytics. Enterprise adds AI safety controls and Microsoft Intune App SDK for device management (MDM).

