## Brand and naming conventions

The product is always **Goodnotes** (not GoodNotes); the app is simply called **Goodnotes** — do not refer to it as Goodnotes 6 or abbreviate it as GN6; hyphenate compound terms (AI-powered, note-taking); approved tagline is **Notes Reimagined**; approved concepts include Digital Paper, Digital Ink, Smart Ink, Handwriting experience.
